---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Hearth · A local workspace with no account or subscription"
  description="Projects, schedule, and notes in one place. A quiet local workspace that stays on your Mac."
  locale="en"
  path="/"
>
  <section data-home class="bg-ink text-paper">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 pb-16 pt-20 md:px-12 md:pb-24 md:pt-28">
      <div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.82fr_1.18fr] lg:gap-14">
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-paper/55">Hearth 1.1 · macOS</p>
          <h1 class="mt-5 text-[clamp(3.2rem,8vw,6.8rem)] font-extralight leading-[0.94] tracking-[-0.045em]">Keep the flow<br/>in one place.</h1>
          <p class="mt-8 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-paper/72 md:text-xl">Bring projects, schedule, and notes into one quiet workspace. No account. No subscription. Your data stays on your Mac.</p>
          <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
            <a href="https://apps.apple.com/app/hearth/id6764480247?mt=12" class="rounded-xl bg-paper px-6 py-3.5 text-center font-medium text-ink transition-colors hover:bg-bone">Buy on the Mac App Store</a>
            <a href="#hearth-11" class="rounded-xl border border-paper/30 px-6 py-3.5 text-center font-medium text-paper transition-colors hover:border-paper">See Hearth 1.1</a>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-paper/50">One-time purchase · no account · local SQLite</p>
        </div>
        <img src="/screenshots/1.1.0/en/01-workspace.webp" alt="Hearth 1.1 Projects view" width="1600" height="1000" class="w-full rounded-2xl shadow-2xl ring-1 ring-paper/10" fetchpriority="high" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="hearth-11" data-home class="bg-paper">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-24 md:px-12 md:py-32">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ink/55">Built around the real work</p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-[clamp(2.2rem,5vw,4rem)] font-light leading-[1.04] tracking-[-0.03em]">Capture, arrange, and look back.</h2>
      <div class="mt-14 grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2">
        <article class="overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-white/55 ring-1 ring-ink/10">
          <img src="/screenshots/1.1.0/en/02-capture.webp" alt="Hearth Memo board" width="1600" height="1000" loading="lazy" class="w-full" />
          <div class="p-7 md:p-9"><h3 class="text-2xl font-medium">Capture it while it is fresh</h3><p class="mt-3 text-ink/65">Collect thoughts on the Memo board, then revisit the day in Journal.</p></div>
        </article>
        <article class="overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-white/55 ring-1 ring-ink/10">
          <img src="/screenshots/1.1.0/en/03-calendar.webp" alt="Hearth 1.1 monthly calendar" width="1600" height="1000" loading="lazy" class="w-full" />
          <div class="p-7 md:p-9"><h3 class="text-2xl font-medium">See the shape of the month</h3><p class="mt-3 text-ink/65">Event types, colors, and icons keep the context visible.</p></div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section data-home class="bg-ink text-paper">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-12 px-6 py-24 md:px-12 md:py-32 lg:grid-cols-[0.7fr_1.3fr]">
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-paper/50">Calendar, in motion</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-[clamp(2.2rem,5vw,4rem)] font-light leading-[1.04] tracking-[-0.03em]">Drag it.<br/>The date moves.</h2>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-lg text-lg leading-relaxed text-paper/65">A smooth preview follows the pointer, so the schedule lands on the day you intend.</p>
      </div>
      <img src="/screenshots/1.1.0/en/04-drag.webp" alt="Drag to reschedule in Hearth Calendar" width="1600" height="1000" loading="lazy" class="w-full rounded-2xl shadow-2xl ring-1 ring-paper/10" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section data-home class="bg-paper">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-12 px-6 py-24 md:px-12 md:py-32 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <img src="/screenshots/1.1.0/en/05-local.webp" alt="Hearth Journal with local data" width="1600" height="1000" loading="lazy" class="w-full rounded-2xl ring-1 ring-ink/10" />
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ink/55">Local-first, by default</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-[clamp(2.2rem,5vw,4rem)] font-light leading-[1.04] tracking-[-0.03em]">No account.<br/>No subscription.</h2>
        <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/65">Projects, notes, and schedule live in a SQLite file on your Mac. Back it up and move it yourself.</p>
        <p class="mt-6 break-all rounded-xl bg-ink/5 px-4 py-3 font-mono text-sm text-ink/70">~/Library/Application Support/com.codewithgenie.hearth/data.db</p>
        <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-ink/55">Optional AI features connect only when you provide your own API key.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section data-home class="bg-ink text-paper">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-20 md:px-12 md:py-28 text-center">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-paper/50">One purchase. Your workspace.</p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 text-[clamp(2rem,5vw,3.5rem)] font-light leading-tight tracking-[-0.025em]">Keep your workspace on your Mac.</h2>
      <a href="https://apps.apple.com/app/hearth/id6764480247?mt=12" class="mt-10 inline-block rounded-xl bg-paper px-7 py-4 font-medium text-ink transition-colors hover:bg-bone">Buy on the Mac App Store</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
